<title>USA: IPO FILING - Mac-Gray Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Mac-Gray Corp.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mac-Gray Corp said on Monday it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed initial public offering of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company did not set a price range or a proposed size for the deal in its statement.</p>
<p>The company said it will sell all of the shares.</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers and Smith Barney Inc will act as the deal's underwriters.</p>
<p>Mac-Gray operates card and coin-operated laundry services in multiple housing facilities such as apartment buildings. colleges, universities and public housing complexes.</p>
</text>
